s right, that's right, yeah</text><text for="L11">Here and there out there</text><text for="L55">To the fellas</text><text for="L14">Thank you for being part of it all</text><text for="L58">To my friends, and to my family</text><text for="L13">In cherished moments piled up like white snow</text><text for="L57">More than happiness</text><text for="L16">Beautiful Christmas</text><text for="L15">Everybody come have yourself a</text><text for="L59">You mean to me the Christmas time</text><text for="L18">We're on the home stretch, enjoy</text><text for="L17">We've ran with all we had for a year</text><text for="L19">Everybody come have yourself a</text></translation></translations><songwriters><songwriter>ALYSA</songwriter><songwriter>Ayaka Ichinose</songwriter><songwriter>JJean</songwriter><songwriter>Justin Reinstein</songwriter><songwriter>Kim JaeWon</songwriter></songwriters><transliterations><transliteration automaticallyCreated="true" xml:lang="ko-Latn"><text for="L61"><span begin="2:43.645" end="2:43.967" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">It's</span> <span begin="2:43.967" end="2:44.100" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">the</span> <span begin="2:44.100" end="2:44.364" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">best</span> <span begin="2:44.364" end="2:44.631" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">time</span> <span begin="2:44.631" end="2:44.929" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">of</span> <span begin="2:44.929" end="2:45.425" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">the</span></text><text for="L60"><span begin="2:39.443" end="2:39.704" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">Oh,</span> <span begin="2:39.704" end="2:40.271" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">yeah,</span> <span begin="2:40.505" end="2:41.138" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">everybody</span> <span begin="2:41.138" end="2:41.238" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">clap</span> <span begin="2:41.238" end="2:41.338" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">your</span> <span begin="2:41.338" end="2:41.602" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/tt